{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57578","headline":"张华真人二味口诀 · 无名氏","name":"张华真人二味口诀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虎伏龙亦藏，龙潜先伏虎。\n但毕河车功，不用堤防虑。\n黄老学飞仙，狂迷不得路。\n回首指牝鷄，不测阴阳数。\n却坐太一宫，参商方始遇。\n左右得近神，四相皆扶护。\n乾坤法象成，自有仙人顾。\n（按：张华爲西晋时人。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57578.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57578","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}